{"id":"vereinbarung","lemma":"Vereinbarung","pos":"noun","rank":3153,"glosses":["agreement, arrangement","booking (e.g., of an appointment)"],"ipa":"/fɛɐ̯ˈʔaɪ̯nbaːʁʊŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ed/De-Vereinbarung.ogg/De-Vereinbarung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Vereinbarung","plural":"Vereinbarungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Wir haben eine Vereinbarung.","en":"We have an agreement.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Wir hatten eine Vereinbarung.","en":"We had an agreement.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ich dachte, Sie hätten eine Vereinbarung mit Tom.","en":"I thought you had an agreement with Tom.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"denken"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Was für eine Vereinbarung hast du mit Tom geschlossen?","en":"What kind of deal did you make with Tom?","words":[null,null,{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"with"},null,{"g":"shut"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"what"]]},{"text":"Ich will einfach nur sicherstellen, dass du deinen Teil der Vereinbarung einhältst.","en":"I just want to make sure you live up to your end of the bargain.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"easy"},{"g":"only"},{"g":"to seize"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"thy, your .","l":"dein"},{"g":"part, piece"},{"g":"the"},null,null]}]}